      {
       "text": "The official count reached 85% of precincts at 21:18 CET with BSW at 5.2 - above the line, and climbing as more is counted (5.09 at 64%). The evening projection saying 4.8 is the weaker instrument now; it also had AfD at 44.4 against 46.2 actually counted.",
